# Sugar cube 0: a sugar cube (kitchen_sugar), 0.96 m a side with soft edges (60 times life size), turned a little on the worktop. Knee cover and a step up for a
# player: its flat top is at 0.96 m. Convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.25
    Translate translation=(0, 0.48, 0)
        Rotate rotation=(0, 0.25, 0)
            Material material=kitchen_sugar
                RoundBox size=(0.48, 0.48, 0.48) roundness=0.08
